OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry and settled through the evening
OL,7,Fand overnight. Long clear spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping which will lead to a cold
OL,9,Fand frosty night. Winds will be light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FAfter a cold and frosty start,
OL,12,Fit will be a dry day with largely
OL,13,Fclear skies and plenty of sunshine.
OL,14,FFrost returning in the evening.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,17,Fdry Saturday and Sunday with the odd
OL,18,Fshower possible and sunny spells, cold
OL,19,Fand frosty overnight. Mostly dry and
OL,20,Fbright on Monday but chance of some
OL,21,Frain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
